    "title": "Hyakkano Interactive Wallpaper - Community Edition",
    "description": "Interactive wallpaper\r\n\r\nUnofficial content of \"The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really, Really, Really, Really Love You\"\r\n\r\nIncludes first 10 girlfriends\r\n \r\nX/Twitter of Artists (Left to right)\r\nHakari: @i_am_meenoi\r\nKarane: @i_am_meenoi\r\nShizuka: @i_am_meenoi\r\nNano: @i_am_meenoi\r\nKusuri: @TonsofScrap\r\nHahari: @DinisGraff100\r\nKurumi: @itsyaboi_kroggu\r\nMei: @komykel\r\nIku: @AnMinhanpham30\r\nMimimi: @rinko__0515",
